{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Imam Ali al-Reza (a.s.) — Mashhad (All Forms)",
  "data": "Permission to Enter (Izn)\nAt the door of the shrine, stop and ask permission to enter:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْ وَقَفْتُ عَلٰى بَابٍ مِنْ اَبْوَابِ بُيُوْتِ نَبِيِّكَ صَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE WAQAFTU A'LAA BAABIN MIN ABWAABI BUYOOTI NABIYYIKA SALAWAATUKA A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nO Allah I stand still at one of the doors of the houses of Your Prophet (Your blessings be on him and on his children),\nوَقَدْ مَنَعْتَ النَّاسَ اَنْ يَّدْخُلُوْا اِلَّا بِاِذْنِهٖ\nWA QAD MANA'TAN NAASA AN YADKHULOO ILLAA BI-IDHNIH\nbecause people are not allowed to enter without his permission.\nفَقُلْتَ يَآ اَيُّهَا الَّذِيْنَ اٰمَنُوْا لَا تَدْخُلُوْا بُيُوْتَ النَّبِيِّ اِلَّا اَنْ يُّؤْذَنَ لَكُمْ\nFAQULTA YAA AYYUHAL LADHEENA AAMANOO LAA TADKHULOO BUYOOTAN NABIYYI ILLAA AN YU'DHANA LAKUM\nSo You said: “O you who believe! Enter not the dwellings of the Prophet unless permission be granted to you.”\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْ اَعْتَقِدُ حُرْمَةَ صَاحِبِ هٰذَا الْمَشْهَدِ الشَّرِيْفِ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE A'TAQIDU HURMATA SAAHIBI HAADHAL MASH-HADISH SHAREEF\nO Allah! I hold (as an article of faith) this honoured place of pilgrimage as sacred,\nفِيْ غَيْبَتِهٖ كَمَآ اَعْتَقِدُهَا فِيْ حَضْرَتِهٖ\nFEE GHAYBATIHEE KAMAA A'TAQIDUHAA FEE HADRATIH\nin his invisibility just as I was certain and sure of his sanctity in his presence.\nوَاَعْلَمُ اَنَّ رَسُوْلَكَ وَخُلَفَآئَكَ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ اَحْيَآءٌ\nWA A'LAMU ANNA RASOOLAKA WA KHULAFAA'AKA A'LAYHIMUS SALAAMU AHYAA'\nI know that Your Apostle and Your Representatives (peace be on them) are alive,\nعِنْدَكَ يُرْزَقُوْنَ يَرَوْنَ مَقَامِيْ\nI'NDAKA YURZAQOONA YARAWNA MAQAAMEE\nby Your permission and are being sustained, seeing my place of halting,\nوَيَسْمَعُوْنَ كَلَامِيْ وَيَرُدُّوْنَ سَلَامِيْ\nWA YASMA'OONA KALAAMEE WA YARUDDOONA SALAAMEE\nhearing my words and answering my “Salaam”.\nوَاَنَّكَ حَجَبْتَ عَنْ سَمْعِيْ كَلَامَهُمْ\nWA ANNAKA HAJABTA A'N SAM'EE KALAAMAHUM\nAlthough You have shut off their speech from my hearing\nوَفَتَحْتَ بَابَ فَهْمِيْ بِلَذِيْذِ مُنَاجَاتِهِمْ\nWA FATAHTA BAABA FAHMEE BILADHEEDHI MUNAAJAATIHIM\nbut has unbolted the door of my understanding, because of my delightful recitation of their merits.\nوَاِنِّيْ اَسْتَاْذِنُكَ يَا رَبِّ اَوَّلًا وَّاَسْتَاْذِنُ رَسُوْلَكَ صَلَّى اللهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ ثَانِيًا\nWA INNEE ASTA'DHINUKA YAA RABBI AWWALAN WA ASTA'DHINU RASOOLAKA SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIHEE THAANIYAA\nFirst I ask for Your permission O my Lord and then seek Your Apostle’s leave (Blessings of Allah be on him and on his children)\nوَاَسْتَاْذِنُ خَلِيْفَتَكَ الْاِمَامَ الْمَفْرُوْضَ عَلَيَّ طَاعَتُهٗ\nWA ASTA'DHINU KHALEEFATAKAL IMAAMAL MAFROODA A'LAYYA TAA'ATUH\nand take permission from Your representative, obedience unto whom has been made obligatory on me,\nعَلِيِّ بْنِ مُوْسَى الرِّضَا عَلَيْهِمَا السَّلَامُ\nA'LIYYIBNI MOOSAR RIDAA A'LAYHIMAS SALAAM\nAli Ibn Moosa al-Reza (a.s.),\nوَالْمَلٰٓئِكَةَ الْمُوَكَّلِيْنَ بِهٰذِهِ الْبُقْعَةِ الْمُبَارَكَةِ ثَالِثًا\nWAL MALAA'IKATAL MUWAKKALEENA BIHAADHIHIL BUQ'ATIL MUBAARAKATI THAALITHAA\nAnd also from the angels, appointed as guardians of this blessed precinct.\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللهِ ءَاَدْخُلُ يَا حُجَّةَ اللهِ\nA-ADKHULU YAA RASOOLALLAAHI A-ADKHULU YAA HUJJATALLAAH\nMay I enter O Apostle of Allah? May I enter O Hujjatullah (proof of Allah)?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَلٰٓئِكَةَ اللهِ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ الْمُقِيْمِيْنَ فِيْ هٰذَا الْمَشْهَدِ\nA-ADKHULU YAA MALAA'IKATALLAAHIL MUQARRABEENAL MUQEEMEENA FEE HAADHAL MASH-HAD\nMay I enter O favourite angels of Allah, quartered in this place of pilgrimage ?\nفَاْذَنْ لِيْ يَا مَوْلَايَ فِي الدُّخُوْلِ اَفْضَلَ مَآ اَذِنْتَ لِاَحَدٍ مِّنْ اَوْلِيَآئِكَ\nFA'DHAN LEE YAA MAWLAAYA FID DUKHOOLI AFDALA MAA ADHINTA LI-AHADIM MIN AWLIYAA'IK\nGive permission to enter, O my Master, a most cordial welcome that is extended to any of your closest friends;\nفَاِنْ لَمْ اَكُنْ اَهْلًا لِذٰلِكَ فَاَنْتَ اَهْلٌ لَهٗ\nFA-IN LAM AKUN AHLAN LIDHAALIKA FA-ANTA AHLUN LAH\nmay be I do not deserve it, but you are known to do it.\nIf your heart softens and your eyes fill with tears, take it as the sign that permission has been given, and enter.",
  "tabs": [
    "First Ziyarat\nBefore setting out from home for the ziyarat, perform ghusl and recite while bathing:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ طَهِّرْنِيْ وَطَهِّرْ لِيْ قَلْبِيْ\nALLAAHUMMA TAHHIRNEE WA TAHHIR LEE QALBEE\nO Allah, (please) cleanse me, cleanse my heart,\nوَاشْرَحْ لِيْ صَدْرِيْ\nWASHRAH LEE SADREE\nexpand my breast,\nوَاَجْرِ عَلٰى لِسَانِيْ مِدْحَتَكَ وَالثَّنَاۤءَ عَلَيْكَ\nWA AJRI A'LAA LISAANEE MID-HATAKA WATH THANAA'A A'LAYK\nand let Your praise and eulogy flow out from my tongue;\nفَاِنَّهٗ لَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِكَ\nFA-INNAHOO LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BIK\nsince indeed there is neither might nor power except with You.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْهُ لِيْ طَهُوْرًا وَشِفَاۤءً\nALLAAHUMMAJ A'LHU LEE TAHOORAN WA SHIFAA'AA\nO Allah, (please) establish it as a means of cleansing and healing for me.\nAs you leave your house, recite:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ وَبِاللّٰهِ\nBISMILLAAHI WA BILLAAH\nIn the Name of Allah (I begin), in Allah (I trust),\nوَاِلَى اللّٰهِ وَاِلَى ابْنِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nWA ILALLAAHI WA ILABNI RASOOLILLAAH\nto Allah and towards the son of Allah’s Messenger (I turn my face).\nحَسْبِيَ اللّٰهُ تَوَكَّلْتُ عَلَى اللّٰهِ\nHASBIYALLAAHU TAWAKKALTU A'LALLAAH\nAllah is Sufficient unto me and on Allah do I rely.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِلَيْكَ تَوَجَّهْتُ وَاِلَيْكَ قَصَدْتُ\nALLAAHUMMA ILAYKA TAWAJJAHTU WA ILAYKA QASADT\nO Allah, I have set out to You, directed toward You,\nوَمَا عِنْدَكَ اَرَدْتُ\nWA MAA I'NDAKA ARADT\nand desired for what You have in possession.\nStop at the door of your house and recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِلَيْكَ وَجَّهْتُ وَجْهِيْ\nALLAAHUMMA ILAYKA WAJJAHTU WAJHEE\nO Allah, to You am I turning my face\nوَعَلَيْكَ خَلَّفْتُ اَهْلِيْ وَمَالِيْ وَمَا خَوَّلْتَنِيْ\nWA A'LAYKA KHALLAFTU AHLEE WA MAALEE WA MAA KHAWWALTANEE\nand with You do I keep my family members, my property, and everything with which You have allowed me to behave.\nوَبِكَ وَثِقْتُ فَلَا تُخَيِّبْنِيْ\nWA BIKA WATHIQTU FALAA TUKHAYYIBNEE\nI have trusted in You; so, do not disappoint me.\nيَا مَنْ لَا يُخَيِّبُ مَنْ اَرَادَهٗ\nYAA MAN LAA YUKHAYYIBU MAN ARAADAH\nO He Who saves those who trust in Him from disappointment\nوَلَا يُضَيِّعُ مَنْ حَفِظَهٗ\nWA LAA YUDAYYI'U MAN HAFIZAH\nand He Who does not give up those whom He safeguards.\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please do) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَاحْفَظْنِيْ بِحِفْظِكَ\nWAHFAZNEE BIHIFZIK\nand guard me under Your custody,\nفَاِنَّهٗ لَا يَضِيْعُ مَنْ حَفِظْتَ\nFA-INNAHOO LAA YADEE'U MAN HAFIZT\nsince nothing that You guard may be ruined.\nWhen you arrive, perform ghusl for the ziyarat and recite while bathing:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ طَهِّرْنِيْ وَطَهِّرْ لِيْ قَلْبِيْ\nALLAAHUMMA TAHHIRNEE WA TAHHIR LEE QALBEE\nO Allah, (please) cleanse me, cleanse my heart for me,\nوَاشْرَحْ لِيْ صَدْرِيْ\nWASHRAH LEE SADREE\nexpand my breast,\nوَاَجْرِ عَلٰى لِسَانِيْ مِدْحَتَكَ وَمَحَبَّتَكَ وَالثَّنَاۤءَ عَلَيْكَ\nWA AJRI A'LAA LISAANEE MID-HATAKA WA MAHABBATAKA WATH THANAA'A A'LAYK\nand let Your praise, eulogy, and love flow out from my tongue;\nفَاِنَّهٗ لَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِكَ\nFA-INNAHOO LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BIK\nsince indeed there is no power except with You.\nوَقَدْ عَلِمْتُ اَنَّ قِوَامَ دِيْنِيْ\nWA QAD A'LIMTU ANNA QIWAAMA DEENEE\nI know for sure that the basis of my faith\nالتَّسْلِيْمُ لِاَمْرِكَ وَالْاِتِّبَاعُ لِسُنَّةِ نَبِيِّكَ\nAT-TASLEEMU LI-AMRIKA WAL ITTIBAA'U LISUNNATI NABIYYIK\nis to submit to Your decree, to keep to the traditions of Your Prophet,\nوَالشَّهَادَةُ عَلٰى جَمِيْعِ خَلْقِكَ\nWASH SHAHAADATU A'LAA JAMEE'I KHALQIK\nand to bear witness to all Your creatures.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْهُ لِيْ شِفَاۤءً وَنُوْرًا\nALLAAHUMMAJ A'LHU LEE SHIFAA'AN WA NOORAA\nO Allah, (please) make it curative and light for me.\nاِنَّكَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْ‏ءٍ قَدِيْرٌ.\nINNAKA A'LAA KULLI SHAY'IN QADEER\nYou verily have power over all things.\nPut on your purest and cleanest clothes, and walk barefoot, calmly and humbly, repeating in your heart:\nاَللهُ اَكْبَرُ\nALLAAHU AKBAR\nAllah is the Most Great.\nلَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ\nLAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAH\nThere is no god save Allah.\nسُبْحَانَ اللهِ\nSUBHAANALLAAH\nAll glory be to Allah.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAH\nAll praise be to Allah.\nAfter asking permission to enter, recite as you enter the shrine:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ وَبِاللّٰهِ\nBISMILLAAHI WA BILLAAH\nIn the Name of Allah (I begin), in Allah (I trust),\nوَعَلٰى مِلَّةِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nWA A'LAA MILLATI RASOOLILLAAH\nand the course of Allah’s Messenger (I follow),\nصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIH\npeace be upon him and his Household.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنْ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ\nASH-HADU AN LAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAH\nI bear witness that there is no god save Allah,\nوَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ\nWAHDAHOO LAA SHAREEKA LAH\nOne and Only God and having no partner.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهٗ وَرَسُوْلُهٗ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNA MUHAMMADAN A'BDUHOO WA RASOOLUH\nAnd I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger\nوَاَنَّ عَلِيًّا وَلِيُّ اللّٰهِ\nWA ANNA A'LIYYAN WALIYYULLAAH\nand `Ali is Allah’s most intimate servant.\nWalk to the tomb, stand facing it, and recite:\nاَشْهَدُ اَنْ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ\nASH-HADU AN LAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAH\nI bear witness that there is no god save Allah,\nوَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ\nWAHDAHOO LAA SHAREEKA LAH\nOne and Only God and having no partner.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهٗ وَرَسُوْلُهٗ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNA MUHAMMADAN A'BDUHOO WA RASOOLUH\nAnd I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger,\nوَاَنَّهٗ سَيِّدُ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَالْاٰخِرِيْنَ\nWA ANNAHOO SAYYIDUL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHIREEN\nthe chief of the past and the coming generations,\nوَاَنَّهٗ سَيِّدُ الْاَنْبِيَاۤءِ وَالْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA ANNAHOO SAYYIDUL ANBIYAA'I WAL MURSALEEN\nand the chief of the Prophets and Messengers.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please) bless Muhammad,\nعَبْدِكَ وَرَسُوْلِكَ وَنَبِيِّكَ\nA'BDIKA WA RASOOLIKA WA NABIYYIK\nYour servant, messenger, prophet,\nوَسَيِّدِ خَلْقِكَ اَجْمَعِيْنَ\nWA SAYYIDI KHALQIKA AJMA'EEN\nand the chief of all Your creatures,\nصَلٰوةً لَا يَقْوٰى عَلٰۤى اِحْصَاۤئِهَا غَيْرُكَ\nSALAATAN LAA YAQWAA A'LAA IHSAA'IHAA GHAYRUK\nwith such blessings that none can calculate save You.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰۤى اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA AMEERIL MU'MINEEN\nO Allah, (please) bless the Commander of the Faithful\nعَلِيِّ بْنِ اَبِيْ طَالِبٍ\nA'LIYYIBNI ABEE TAALIB\n`Ali the son of Abi-Talib,\nعَبْدِكَ وَاَخِيْ رَسُوْلِكَ\nA'BDIKA WA AKHEE RASOOLIK\nYour servant and the brother of Your Messenger,\nالَّذِيْ انْتَجَبْتَهٗ بِعِلْمِكَ\nALLADHIN TAJABTAHOO BI-I'LMIK\nwhom You have selected on the basis of Your knowledge\nوَجَعَلْتَهٗ هَادِيًا لِمَنْ شِئْتَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ\nWA JA'ALTAHOO HAADIYAN LIMAN SHI'TA MIN KHALQIK\nand thus made lead (to the truth) whomever You willed amongst Your creatures\nوَالدَّلِيْلَ عَلٰى مَنْ بَعَثْتَهٗ بِرِسَالَاتِكَ\nWAD DALEELA A'LAA MAN BA'ATHTAHOO BIRISAALAATIK\nand made the guide to those whom You sent with Your messages,\nوَدَيَّانَ الدِّيْنِ بِعَدْلِكَ\nWA DAYYAANAD DEENI BI-A'DLIK\nthe establisher of the true religion owing to Your justice,\nوَفَصْلَ قَضَاۤئِكَ بَيْنَ خَلْقِكَ\nWA FASLA QADAA'IKA BAYNA KHALQIK\nthe decisive judge among Your creatures,\nوَالْمُهَيْمِنَ عَلٰى ذٰلِكَ كُلِّهٖ\nWAL MUHAYMINA A'LAA DHAALIKA KULLIH\nand the prevalent over all that.\nوَالسَّلَامُ عَلَيْهِ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ.\nWAS SALAAMU A'LAYHI WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace and Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon him.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى فَاطِمَةَ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA FAATIMAH\nO Allah, (please) send blessings on Fatimah\nبِنْتِ نَبِيِّكَ\nBINTI NABIYYIK\nthe daughter of Your Prophet,\nوَزَوْجَةِ وَلِيِّكَ\nWA ZAWJATI WALIYYIK\nthe wife of Your friend,\nوَاُمِّ السِّبْطَيْنِ الْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَيْنِ\nWA UMMIS SIBTAYNIL HASANI WAL HUSAYN\nthe mother of the two grandsons al-Hasan and al-Husayn\nسَيِّدَيْ شَبَابِ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ\nSAYYIDAY SHABAABI AHLIL JANNAH\nthe two chiefs of the youth of Paradise;\nالطُّهْرَةِ الطَّاهِرَةِ الْمُطَهَّرَةِ\nAT-TUHRATIT TAAHIRATIL MUTAHHARAH\n(she is) the genuinely pure, the immaculate, the purified,\nالتَّقِيَّةِ النَّقِيَّةِ الرَّضِيَّةِ الزَّكِيَّةِ\nAT-TAQIYYATIN NAQIYYATIR RADIYYATIZ ZAKIYYAH\nthe pious, the perfect, the pleased, the pristine,\nسَيِّدَةِ نِسَاۤءِ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ اَجْمَعِيْنَ\nSAYYIDATI NISAA'I AHLIL JANNATI AJMA'EEN\nand the doyenne of all the women of Paradise,\nصَلٰوةً لَا يَقْوٰى عَلٰۤى اِحْصَاۤئِهَا غَيْرُكَ\nSALAATAN LAA YAQWAA A'LAA IHSAA'IHAA GHAYRUK\n(bless her) with such blessings that none can count except You.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى الْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَيْنِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAL HASANI WAL HUSAYN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon al-Hasan and al-Husayn,\nسِبْطَيْ نَبِيِّكَ\nSIBTAY NABIYYIK\nthe two grandsons of Your Prophet,\nوَسَيِّدَيْ شَبَابِ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ\nWA SAYYIDAY SHABAABI AHLIL JANNAH\nthe two chiefs of the youth of Paradise,\nالْقَاۤئِمَيْنِ فِيْ خَلْقِكَ\nAL-QAA'IMAYNI FEE KHALQIK\nthe two who establish authority among Your creatures,\nوَالدَّلِيْلَيْنِ عَلٰى مَنْ بَعَثْتَ بِرِسَالَاتِكَ\nWAD DALEELAYNI A'LAA MAN BA'ATHTA BIRISAALAATIK\nwho guide to those whom You sent with Your messages,\nوَدَيَّانَيِ الدِّيْنِ بِعَدْلِكَ\nWA DAYYAANAYID DEENI BI-A'DLIK\nwho manage the religious affairs on the basis of Your justice,\nوَفَصْلَيْ قَضَاۤئِكَ بَيْنَ خَلْقِكَ.\nWA FASLAY QADAA'IKA BAYNA KHALQIK\nand who judge on the basis of Your decrees among Your creatures.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى عَلِيِّ بْنِ الْحُسَيْنِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA A'LIYYIBNIL HUSAYN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon `Ali the son of al-Husayn,\nعَبْدِكَ الْقَاۤئِمِ فِيْ خَلْقِكَ\nA'BDIKAL QAA'IMI FEE KHALQIK\nYour servant who undertakes Your mission among Your creatures,\nوَالدَّلِيْلِ عَلٰى مَنْ بَعَثْتَ بِرِسَالَاتِكَ\nWAD DALEELI A'LAA MAN BA'ATHTA BIRISAALAATIK\nwho guides to those whom You sent with Your messages,\nوَدَيَّانِ الدِّيْنِ بِعَدْلِكَ\nWA DAYYAANID DEENI BI-A'DLIK\nwho manages the religious affairs on the basis of Your justice,\nوَفَصْلِ قَضَاۤئِكَ بَيْنَ خَلْقِكَ\nWA FASLI QADAA'IKA BAYNA KHALQIK\nwho judges according to Your decrees among Your creatures,\nسَيِّدِ الْعَابِدِيْنَ\nSAYYIDIL A'ABIDEEN\nand who is the prime of all worshippers.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIBNI A'LIYY\nO Allah, (please) send blessings on Muhammad the son of `Ali,\nعَبْدِكَ وَخَلِيْفَتِكَ فِيْۤ اَرْضِكَ\nA'BDIKA WA KHALEEFATIKA FEE ARDIK\nYour servant and Your representative in Your lands,\nبَاقِرِ عِلْمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nBAAQIRI I'LMIN NABIYYEEN\nwho split asunder the knowledge of the Prophets.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى جَعْفَرِ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ ۟اِلصَّادِقِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA JA'FARIBNI MUHAMMADINIS SAADIQ\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Ja`far the son of Muhammad,\nعَبْدِكَ وَوَلِيِّ دِيْنِكَ\nA'BDIKA WA WALIYYI DEENIK\nYour servant, the authority of Your religion,\nوَحُجَّتِكَ عَلٰى خَلْقِكَ اَجْمَعِيْنَ\nWA HUJJATIKA A'LAA KHALQIKA AJMA'EEN\nYour argument against all of Your creatures,\nالصَّادِقِ الْبَآرِّ\nAS-SAADIQIL BAARR\nthe veracious, and the dutiful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُوْسَى بْنِ جَعْفَرٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MOOSABNI JA'FAR\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Musa the son of Ja`far,\nعَبْدِكَ الصَّالِحِ\nA'BDIKAS SAALIH\nYour righteous servant,\nوَلِسَانِكَ فِيْ خَلْقِكَ\nWA LISAANIKA FEE KHALQIK\nYour spokesman among Your creatures,\nالنَّاطِقِ بِحُكْمِكَ\nAN-NAATIQI BIHUKMIK\nwho speaks with Your judgment,\nوَالْحُجَّةِ عَلٰى بَرِيَّتِكَ\nWAL HUJJATI A'LAA BARIYYATIK\nand who is the argument against Your created beings.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى عَلِيِّ بْنِ مُوْسَى\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA A'LIYYIBNI MOOSAA\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon `Ali the son of Musa,\nالرِّضَا الْمُرْتَضٰى\nAR-RIDAL MURTADAA\nthe cordial, the well-pleased,\nعَبْدِكَ وَوَلِيِّ دِيْنِكَ\nA'BDIKA WA WALIYYI DEENIK\nthe servant of You, the authority of Your religion,\nالْقَاۤئِمِ بِعَدْلِكَ\nAL-QAA'IMI BI-A'DLIK\nwho undertakes the mission with Your justice,\nوَالدَّاعِيْۤ اِلٰى دِيْنِكَ وَدِيْنِ اٰبَاۤئِهِ الصَّادِقِيْنَ\nWAD DAA'EE ILAA DEENIKA WA DEENI AABAA'IHIS SAADIQEEN\nwho calls to the religion of You and of his veracious fathers;\nصَلٰوةً لَا يَقْوٰى عَلٰۤى اِحْصَاۤئِهَا غَيْرُكَ\nSALAATAN LAA YAQWAA A'LAA IHSAA'IHAA GHAYRUK\n(bless him) with such blessings that none can count except You.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIBNI A'LIYY\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Muhammad the son of `Ali,\nعَبْدِكَ وَوَلِيِّكَ\nA'BDIKA WA WALIYYIK\nYour servant, Your authority,\nالْقَاۤئِمِ بِاَمْرِكَ\nAL-QAA'IMI BI-AMRIK\nwho undertakes the mission by Your command\nوَالدَّاعِيْۤ اِلٰى سَبِيْلِكَ\nWAD DAA'EE ILAA SABEELIK\nand calls to Your path.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى عَلِيِّ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA A'LIYYIBNI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (please) send blessing upon `Ali the son of Muhammad,\nعَبْدِكَ وَوَلِيِّ دِيْنِكَ.\nA'BDIKA WA WALIYYI DEENIK\nYour servant and the authority of Your religion.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى الْحَسَنِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAL HASANIBNI A'LIYY\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon al-Hasan the son of `Ali\n۟اِلْعَامِلِ بِاَمْرِكَ\nAL-A'AMILI BI-AMRIK\nwho carries out Your commands,\nالْقَاۤئِمِ فِيْ خَلْقِكَ\nAL-QAA'IMI FEE KHALQIK\nwho undertakes the mission among Your creatures,\nوَحُجَّتِكَ الْمُؤَدِّيْ عَنْ نَبِيِّكَ\nWA HUJJATIKAL MU'ADDEE A'N NABIYYIK\nYour argument who acts on behalf of Your Prophet,\nوَشَاهِدِكَ عَلٰى خَلْقِكَ\nWA SHAAHIDIKA A'LAA KHALQIK\nYour witness on Your creatures,\nالْمَخْصُوْصِ بِكَرَامَتِكَ\nAL-MAKHSOOSI BIKARAAMATIK\nthe exclusively endued with Your honor,\nالدَّاعِيْۤ اِلٰى طَاعَتِكَ وَطَاعَةِ رَسُوْلِكَ\nAD-DAA'EE ILAA TAA'ATIKA WA TAA'ATI RASOOLIK\nand the caller to the obedience to You and to Your Messenger.\nصَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِمْ اَجْمَعِيْنَ\nSALAWAATUKA A'LAYHIM AJMA'EEN\nYour blessings be upon them all.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى حُجَّتِكَ وَوَلِيِّكَ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA HUJJATIKA WA WALIYYIK\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Your argument and authority\nالْقَاۤئِمِ فِيْ خَلْقِكَ\nAL-QAA'IMI FEE KHALQIK\nwho undertakes the mission among Your creatures\nصَلٰوةً تَآمَّةً نَامِيَةً بَاقِيَةً\nSALAATAN TAAMMATAN NAAMIYATAN BAAQIYAH\nwith such blessing that is perfect, ever-increasing, and everlasting\nتُعَجِّلُ بِهَا فَرَجَهٗ\nTU'AJJILU BIHAA FARAJAH\ndue to which You may hasten his Relief,\nوَتَنْصُرُهٗ بِهَا\nWA TANSURUHOO BIHAA\ngrant him victory,\nوَتَجْعَلُنَا مَعَهٗ فِيْ الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ\nWA TAJ'ALUNAA MA'AHOO FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRAH\nand include us with him in this world and the Hereafter.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْۤ اَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَيْكَ بِحُبِّهِمْ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ATAQARRABU ILAYKA BIHUBBIHIM\nO Allah, I am seeking nearness to You through bearing love for them,\nوَاُوَالِيْ وَلِيَّهُمْ وَاُعَادِيْ عَدُوَّهُمْ\nWA UWAALEE WALIYYAHUM WA U'AADEE A'DUWWAHUM\nand I am loyal to their loyalists and enemy of their enemies.\nفَارْزُقْنِيْ بِهِمْ خَيْرَ الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ\nFARZUQNEE BIHIM KHAYRAD DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRAH\nSo (please) provide me in their names the goodness of this world and the Hereafter\nوَاصْرِفْ عَنِّيْ بِهِمْ شَرَّ الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ\nWASRIF A'NNEE BIHIM SHARRAD DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRAH\nand fend off from me the evils of this world and the Hereafter\nوَاَهْوَالَ يَوْمِ الْقِيَامَةِ.\nWA AHWAALA YAWMIL QIYAAMAH\nas well as the horrors of the Resurrection Day.\nThen sit at the side of the Imam’s head and recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WALIYYALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s friend.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA HUJJATALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s argument.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُوْرَ اللّٰهِ فِيْ ظُلُمَاتِ الْاَرْضِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA NOORALLAAHI FEE ZULUMAATIL ARD\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s light in the darkness of the earth.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَمُوْدَ الدِّيْنِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA A'MOODAD DEEN\nPeace be upon you, O pillar of the religion.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ اٰدَمَ صَفْوَةِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA AADAMA SAFWATILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Adam the choice of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ نُوْحٍ نَبِيِّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA NOOHIN NABIYYILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Noah the prophet of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ اِبْرَاهِيْمَ خَلِيْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA IBRAAHEEMA KHALEELILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Abraham the intimate friend of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ اِسْمَاعِيْلَ ذَبِيْحِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA ISMAA'EELA DHABEEHILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Ishmael the slain for the sake of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُوْسٰى كَلِيْمِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA MOOSAA KALEEMILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Moses the spoken by Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ عِيْسٰى رُوْحِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA I'EESAA ROOHILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Jesus the spirit of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُحَمَّدٍ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA MUHAMMADIN RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Muhammad the messenger of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA AMEERIL MU'MINEEN\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of the Commander of the Faithful\nعَلِيٍّ وَلِيِّ اللّٰهِ\nA'LIYYIN WALIYYILLAAH\n`Ali the authority of Allah\nوَوَصِيِّ رَسُوْلِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nWA WASIYYI RASOOLI RABBIL A'ALAMEEN\nand the successor of the Messenger of the Lord of the worlds.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ فَاطِمَةَ الزَّهْرَاۤءِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA FAATIMATAZ ZAHRAA'\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Fatimah the luminous lady.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ الْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَيْنِ،\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHAL HASANI WAL HUSAYN\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of al-Hasan and al-Husayn\nسَيِّدَيْ شَبَابِ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ\nSAYYIDAY SHABAABI AHLIL JANNAH\nthe two chiefs of the youth of Paradise.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ عَلِيِّ بْنِ الْحُسَيْنِ زَيْنِ الْعَابِدِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA A'LIYYIBNIL HUSAYNI ZAYNIL A'ABIDEEN\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of `Ali the son of al-Husayn the adornment of the worshippers.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA MUHAMMADIBNI A'LIYY\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Muhammad the son of `Ali\nبَاقِرِ عِلْمِ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَالْاٰخِرِيْنَ\nBAAQIRI I'LMIL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHIREEN\nthe splitter of the knowledge of the past and the last generations.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ جَعْفَرِ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA JA'FARIBNI MUHAMMAD\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Ja`far the son of Muhammad\n۟اِلصَّادِقِ الْبَآرِّ\nAS-SAADIQIL BAARR\nthe veracious and dutiful.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُوْسَى بْنِ جَعْفَرٍ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA MOOSABNI JA'FAR\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Musa the son of Ja`far.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الصِّدِّيْقُ الشَّهِيْدُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAS SIDDEEQUSH SHAHEED\nPeace be upon you, O ever-truthful and martyr.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْوَصِيُّ الْبَآرُّ التَّقِيُّ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAL WASIYYUL BAARRUT TAQIYY\nPeace be upon you, O dutiful and pious successor.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْ اَقَمْتَ الصَّلَاةَ\nASH-HADU ANNAKA QAD AQAMTAS SALAAH\nI bear witness that you performed the prayers,\nوَاٰتَيْتَ الزَّكَاةَ\nWA AATAYTAZ ZAKAAH\ndefrayed the poor-rate (and alms),\nوَاَمَرْتَ بِالْمَعْرُوْفِ\nWA AMARTA BIL MA'ROOF\nenjoined the right,\nوَنَهَيْتَ عَنِ الْمُنْكَرِ\nWA NAHAYTA A'NIL MUNKAR\nforbade the wrong,\nوَعَبَدْتَ اللّٰهَ مُخْلِصًا حَتّٰىۤ اَتَاكَ الْيَقِيْنُ\nWA A'BADTALLAAHA MUKHLISAN HATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEEN\nand serve Allah sincerely until death came upon you.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَاۤ اَبَا الْحَسَنِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA ABAL HASAN\nPeace be upon you, O Abu’l-Hasan.\nوَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ.\nWA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nAllah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nThen lay yourself on the tomb and recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِلَيْكَ صَمَدْتُ مِنْ اَرْضِيْ\nALLAAHUMMA ILAYKA SAMADTU MIN ARDEE\nO Allah, for Your sake alone have I set out from my homeland\nوَقَطَعْتُ الْبِلَادَ رَجَاۤءَ رَحْمَتِكَ\nWA QATA'TUL BILAADA RAJAA'A RAHMATIK\nand covered many countries in the hope of winning Your mercy;\nفَلَا تُخَيِّبْنِيْ وَلَا تَرُدَّنِيْ بِغَيْرِ قَضَاۤءِ حَاجَتِيْ\nFALAA TUKHAYYIBNEE WA LAA TARUDDANEE BIGHAYRI QADAA'I HAAJATEE\nso, (please) do not disappoint me and do not make me return without having my needs settled (by You),\nوَارْحَمْ تَقَلُّبِيْ عَلٰى قَبْرِ ابْنِ اَخِيْ رَسُوْلِكَ\nWARHAM TAQALLUBEE A'LAA QABRIBNI AKHEE RASOOLIK\nand have mercy upon my turning over on the tomb of the son of Your Prophet’ brother,\nصَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ\nSALAWAATUKA A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nYour blessings be upon him and his Household.\nبِاَبِيْۤ اَنْتَ وَاُمِّيْ يَا مَوْلَايَ\nBI-ABEE ANTA WA UMMEE YAA MAWLAAY\nMay my father and mother be ransoms for you, O my master.\nاَتَيْتُكَ زَاۤئِرًا وَافِدًا\nATAYTUKA ZAA'IRAN WAAFIDAA\nI have come to you visiting and getting to you,\nعَاۤئِذًا مِمَّا جَنَيْتُ عَلٰى نَفْسِيْ\nA'A'IDHAN MIMMAA JANAYTU A'LAA NAFSEE\nseeking protection against all that which I have committed against myself\nوَاحْتَطَبْتُ عَلٰى ظَهْرِيْ\nWAHTATABTU A'LAA ZAHREE\nand overburdened my back with.\nفَكُنْ لِيْ شَافِعًا اِلَى اللّٰهِ\nFAKUN LEE SHAAFI'AN ILALLAAH\nSo, (please) be my intercessor with Allah\nيَوْمَ فَقْرِيْ وَفَاقَتِيْ\nYAWMA FAQREE WA FAAQATEE\non the day of my poverty and neediness,\nفَلَكَ عِنْدَ اللّٰهِ مَقَامٌ مَحْمُوْدٌ\nFALAKA I'NDALLAAHI MAQAAMUN MAHMOOD\nfor you enjoy with Allah a praiseworthy position\nوَاَنْتَ عِنْدَهٗ وَجِيْهٌ.\nWA ANTA I'NDAHOO WAJEEH\nand you are worthy of regard with Him.\nThen raise your right hand towards the sky, place your left hand on the tomb, and recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْۤ اَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَيْكَ بِحُبِّهِمْ وَبِوِلَايَتِهِمْ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ATAQARRABU ILAYKA BIHUBBIHIM WA BIWILAAYATIHIM\nO Allah, I do seek nearness to You through bearing love for them and being loyal to them;\nاَتَوَلّٰى اٰخِرَهُمْ بِمَا تَوَلَّيْتُ بِهٖ اَوَّلَهُمْ\nATAWALLAA AAKHIRAHUM BIMAA TAWALLAYTU BIHEE AWWALAHUM\nI am loyal to the last of them in the same way as I am loyal to the first\nوَاَبْرَاُ مِنْ كُلِّ وَلِيْجَةٍ دُوْنَهُمْ\nWA ABRA'U MIN KULLI WALEEJATIN DOONAHUM\nand I repudiate any adherence to any one other than them.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنِ الَّذِيْنَ بَدَّلُوْا نِعْمَتَكَ\nALLAAHUMMAL A'NIL LADHEENA BADDALOO NI'MATAK\nO Allah, pour curses on those who have altered Your bounty,\nوَاتَّهَمُوْا نَبِيَّكَ\nWATTAHAMOO NABIYYAK\nsuspected Your Prophet,\nوَجَحَدُوْا بِاٰيَاتِكَ\nWA JAHADOO BI-AAYAATIK\ndenied Your signs,\nوَسَخِرُوْا بِاِمَامِكَ\nWA SAKHIROO BI-IMAAMIK\nscoffed at Your Imam,\nوَحَمَلُوْا النَّاسَ عَلٰۤى اَكْتَافِ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA HAMALUN NAASA A'LAA AKTAAFI AALI MUHAMMAD\nand placed the burden of the people upon the shoulders of Muhammad’s Household.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيۤ اَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَيْكَ بِاللَّعْنَةِ عَلَيْهِمْ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ATAQARRABU ILAYKA BIL LA'NATI A'LAYHIM\nO Allah, I do seek nearness to You through invoking curse on these peoples (i.e. the enemies of the Holy Prophet’s Household)\nوَالْبَرَاۤءَةِ مِنْهُمْ فِيْ الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ يَا رَحْمَانُ.\nWAL BARAA'ATI MINHUM FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRATI YAA RAHMAAN\nand disavowing them in this world and the Hereafter, O All-beneficent Lord.\nThen turn to the side of the Imam’s feet and recite:\nصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْكَ يَاۤ اَبَا الْحَسَنِ\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAYKA YAA ABAL HASAN\nAllah’s blessings be upon you, O Abu’l-Hasan.\nصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلٰى رُوْحِكَ وَبَدَنِكَ\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAA ROOHIKA WA BADANIK\nAllah’s blessings be upon your soul and body.\nصَبَرْتَ وَاَنْتَ الصَّادِقُ الْمُصَدَّقُ\nSABARTA WA ANTAS SAADIQUL MUSADDAQ\nYou did act patiently and you are veracious and believed.\nقَتَلَ اللّٰهُ مَنْ قَتَلَكَ بِالْاَيْدِيْ وَالْاَلْسُنِ.\nQATALALLAAHU MAN QATALAKA BIL AYDEE WAL ALSUN\nMay Allah kill those who killed you with hands and tongues.\nThen invoke Allah’s curse on the killers of Amir al-Mu’minin (a.s.), of Imam Hasan (a.s.) and Imam Husayn (a.s.), and of all the Prophet’s family. Any words will do; this form, taken from narrated duas, is the most fitting:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْ قَتَلَةَ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMAL A'N QATALATA AMEERIL MU'MINEEN\nO Allah, pour curses on the slayers of the Commander of the Faithful,\nوَقَتَلَةَ الْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَيْنِ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ\nWA QATALATAL HASANI WAL HUSAYNI A'LAYHIMUS SALAAM\nthe slayers of al-Hasan and al-Husayn, peace be upon them,\nوَقَتَلَةَ اَهْلِ بَيْتِ نَبِيِّكَ\nWA QATALATA AHLI BAYTI NABIYYIK\nand the slayers of the members of Your Prophet’s Household.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْ اَعْدَاۤءَ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَقَتَلَتَهُمْ\nALLAAHUMMAL A'N A'DAA'A AALI MUHAMMADIN WA QATALATAHUM\nO Allah, curse the enemies and slayers of Muhammad’s family members,\nوَزِدْهُمْ عَذَابًا فَوْقَ الْعَذَابِ\nWA ZID-HUM A'DHAABAN FAWQAL A'DHAAB\nadd up chastisement to the chastisement that You decide for them,\nوَهَوَانًا فَوْقَ هَوَانٍ\nWA HAWAANAN FAWQA HAWAAN\nadd up humility to the humility that You decide for them,\nوَذُلًّا فَوْقَ ذُلٍّ\nWA DHULLAN FAWQA DHULL\nadd up disgrace to the disgrace that You decide for them,\nوَخِزْيًا فَوْقَ خِزْيٍ\nWA KHIZYAN FAWQA KHIZY\nand add up ignominy to the ignominy that You decide for them.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ دُعَّهُمْ اِلَى النَّارِ دَعًّا\nALLAAHUMMA DU''AHUM ILAN NAARI DA''AA\nO Allah, thrust them into Hellfire with disdainful thrusting,\nوَاَرْكِسْهُمْ فِيْۤ اَلِيْمِ عَذَابِكَ رَكْسًا\nWA ARKIS-HUM FEE ALEEMI A'DHAABIKA RAKSAA\ncast them down in the painful torment of You with violent casting,\nوَاحْشُرْهُمْ وَاَتْبَاعَهُمْ اِلٰى جَهَنَّمَ زُمَرًا.\nWAHSHURHUM WA ATBAA'AHUM ILAA JAHANNAMA ZUMARAA\nand drive them and their followers to Hell in groups.\nThen return to the side of the Imam’s head and pray two units: in the first, after [Surah al-Fatihah](A5) recite [Surah Ya-Sin](A40); in the second, after al-Fatihah recite [Surah al-Rahman](A59).\nPray earnestly for yourself, your parents and your brothers and sisters in faith, as much as you can. Stay at the side of the Imam’s head as long as you wish, and offer all your prayers there.",
    "Dua after the Ziyarat Prayer\nAfter the two-unit prayer of the ziyarat, recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْۤ اَسْاَلُكَ يَاۤ اَللّٰهُ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS'ALUKA YAA ALLAAH\nO Allah, I beseech You, O Allah\nالدَّاۤئِمُ فِيْ مُلْكِهِ\nAD-DAA'IMU FEE MULKIH\nWho is permanent in His kingdom,\nالْقَاۤئِمُ فِيْ عِزِّهِ\nAL-QAA'IMU FEE I'ZZIH\nself-subsisting in His almightiness,\nالْمُطَاعُ فِيْ سُلْطَانِهِ\nAL-MUTAA'U FEE SULTAANIH\nobeyed in His authority,\nالْمُتَفَرِّدُ فِيْ كِبْرِيَاۤئِهِ\nAL-MUTAFARRIDU FEE KIBRIYAA'IH\nunique in His pride,\nالْمُتَوَحِّدُ فِيْ دَيْمُوْمِيَّةِ بَقَاۤئِهِ\nAL-MUTAWAHHIDU FEE DAYMOOMIYYATI BAQAA'IH\none and only in the perpetuity of His intransience,\nالْعَادِلُ فِيْ بَرِيَّتِهِ\nAL-A'ADILU FEE BARIYYATIH\nfair with His creatures,\nالْعَالِمُ فِيْ قَضِيَّتِهِ\nAL-A'ALIMU FEE QADIYYATIH\nknowing of His issue,\nالْكَرِيْمُ فِيْ تَاْخِيْرِ عُقُوْبَتِهٖ\nAL-KAREEMU FEE TA'KHEERI U'QOOBATIH\nand noble in delaying His punishment.\nاِلٰهِيْ حَاجَاتِيْ مَصْرُوْفَةٌ اِلَيْكَ\nILAAHEE HAAJAATEE MASROOFATUN ILAYK\nO my God, my requests are aimed at You\nوَاٰمَالِيْ مَوْقُوْفَةٌ لَدَيْكَ\nWA AAMAALEE MAWQOOFATUN LADAYK\nand my hopes are addressed to You exclusively.\nوَكُلَّمَا وَفَّقْتَنِيْ مِنْ خَيْرٍ\nWA KULLAMAA WAFFAQTANEE MIN KHAYR\nAs to all items of goodness that You have granted me the success to attain,\nفَاَنْتَ دَلِيْلِيْ عَلَيْهِ وَطَرِيْقِيْ اِلَيْهِ\nFA-ANTA DALEELEE A'LAYHI WA TAREEQEE ILAYH\nit is You Who is my guide to them and my path towards them.\nيَا قَدِيْرًا لَا تَئُوْدُهُ الْمَطَالِبُ\nYAA QADEERAN LAA TA'OODUHUL MATAALIB\nO Omnipotent Who cannot be thwarted by requests!\nيَا مَلِيًّا يَلْجَاُ اِلَيْهِ كُلُّ رَاغِبٍ\nYAA MALIYYAN YALJA'U ILAYHI KULLU RAAGHIB\nO All-encompassing to Whom desirous ones resort!\nمَا زِلْتُ مَصْحُوْبًا مِنْكَ بِالنِّعَمِ\nMAA ZILTU MAS-HOOBAN MINKA BIN NI'AM\nI have been always endued with bounties from You\nجَارِيًا عَلٰى عَادَاتِ الْاِحْسَانِ وَالْكَرَمِ\nJAARIYAN A'LAA A'ADAATIL IHSAANI WAL KARAM\nand accustomed to receive conferrals and generosity from You.\nاَسْاَلُكَ بِالْقُدْرَةِ النَّافِذَةِ فِيْ جَمِيْعِ الْاَشْيَاۤءِ\nAS'ALUKA BIL QUDRATIN NAAFIDHATI FEE JAMEE'IL ASHYAA'\nI beseech You in the name of the omnipotence to which all things are applicable,\nوَقَضَاۤئِكَ الْمُبْرَمِ الَّذِيْ تَحْجُبُهٗ بِاَيْسَرِ الدُّعَاۤءِ\nWA QADAA'IKAL MUBRAMIL LADHEE TAHJUBUHOO BI-AYSARID DU'AA'\nin the name of Your unstoppable decree that You may stop by the simplest entreaty,\nوَبِالنَّظْرَةِ الَّتِيْ نَظَرْتَ بِهَاۤ اِلَى الْجِبَالِ فَتَشَامَخَتْ\nWA BIN NAZRATIL LATEE NAZARTA BIHAA ILAL JIBAALI FATASHAAMAKHAT\nand in the name of the look with which You looked at the mountains and they thus towered,\nوَاِلَى الْاَرَضِيْنَ فَتَسَطَّحَتْ\nWA ILAL ARADEENA FATASATTAHAT\nat the layers of the earth and they thus flattened,\nوَاِلَى السَّمَاوَاتِ فَارْتَفَعَتْ،\nWA ILAS SAMAAWAATI FARTAFA'AT\nat the heavens and they thus rose,\nوَاِلَى الْبِحَارِ فَتَفَجَّرَتْ\nWA ILAL BIHAARI FATAFAJJARAT\nand at the seas and they thus gushed;\nيَا مَنْ جَلَّ عَنْ اَدَوَاتِ لَحَظَاتِ الْبَشَرِ\nYAA MAN JALLA A'N ADAWAATI LAHAZAATIL BASHAR\nO He Who is too Majestic to have the human beings’ organs of sight\nوَلَطُفَ عَنْ دَقَاۤئِقِ خَطَرَاتِ الْفِكَرِ\nWA LATUFA A'N DAQAA'IQI KHATARAATIL FIKAR\nand Who is too Subtle to be comprehended by the finest line of thinking.\nلَا تُحْمَدُ يَا سَيِّدِيْۤ اِلَّا بِتَوْفِيْقٍ مِنْكَ يَقْتَضِيْ حَمْدًا\nLAA TUHMADU YAA SAYYIDEE ILLAA BITAWFEEQIN MINKA YAQTADEE HAMDAA\nWhenever You, O my master, are praised, this is due to a bestowal of success that You grant and that requires (us) to praise You for it.\nوَلَا تُشْكَرُ عَلٰۤى اَصْغَرِ مِنَّةٍ اِلَّا اسْتَوْجَبْتَ بِهَا شُكْرًا\nWA LAA TUSHKARU A'LAA ASGHARI MINNATIN ILLAS TAWJABTA BIHAA SHUKRAA\nWhenever You are thanked for the least of Your favors, this requires (us) to thank You for this thanking of ours for You.\nفَمَتٰى تُحْصٰى نَعْمَاۤؤُكَ يَاۤ اِلٰهِيْ\nFAMATAA TUHSAA NA'MAA'UKA YAA ILAAHEE\nThen, at what time can Your bounties be calculated, O my God,\nوَتُجَازٰىۤ اٰلَاۤؤُكَ يَا مَوْلَايَ\nWA TUJAAZAA AALAA'UKA YAA MAWLAAY\nor can Your errands be recompensed, O my Lord,\nوَتُكَافَاُ صَنَاۤئِعُكَ يَا سَيِّدِيْ\nWA TUKAAFA'U SANAA'I'UKA YAA SAYYIDEE\nor can Your favors be paid off, O my Master?\nوَمِنْ نِعَمِكَ يَحْمَدُ الْحَامِدُوْنَ\nWA MIN NI'AMIKA YAHMADUL HAAMIDOON\nIt is one of Your bounties that praisers praise You\nوَمِنْ شُكْرِكَ يَشْكُرُ الشَّاكِرُوْنَ\nWA MIN SHUKRIKA YASHKURUSH SHAAKIROON\nand it is one of Your thankworthy acts that thanksgivers thank You.\nوَاَنْتَ الْمُعْتَمَدُ لِلذُّنُوْبِ فِيْ عَفْوِكَ\nWA ANTAL MU'TAMADU LIDH DHUNOOBI FEE A'FWIK\nYou are also the trusted for pardoning sins,\nوَالنَّاشِرُ عَلَى الْخَاطِئِيْنَ جَنَاحَ سَتْرِكَ\nWAN NAASHIRU A'LAL KHAATI'EENA JANAAHA SATRIK\nthe One Who stretches the wing of Your covering on the wrongdoers,\nوَاَنْتَ الْكَاشِفُ لِلضُّرِّ بِيَدِكَ\nWA ANTAL KAASHIFU LID DURRI BIYADIK\nand the One Who relieves from harm with Your Hand.\nفَكَمْ مِنْ سَيِّئَةٍ اَخْفَاهَا حِلْمُكَ حَتّٰى دَخِلَتْ\nFAKAM MIN SAYYI'ATIN AKHFAAHAA HILMUKA HATTAA DAKHILAT\nToo many have been the sins that Your forbearance concealed until they became hidden\nوَحَسَنَةٍ ضَاعَفَهَا فَضْلُكَ حَتّٰى عَظُمَتْ عَلَيْهَا مُجَازَاتُكَ\nWA HASANATIN DAA'AFAHAA FADLUKA HATTAA A'ZUMAT A'LAYHAA MUJAAZAATUK\nand too many are the good deeds that Your favoring multiplied until Your reward for them became massive.\nجَلَلْتَ اَنْ يُخَافَ مِنْكَ اِلَّا الْعَدْلُ\nJALALTA AN YUKHAAFA MINKA ILLAL A'DL\nYou are too Majestic for us to anticipate anything from You save justice\nوَاَنْ يُرْجٰى مِنْكَ اِلَّا الْاِحْسَانُ وَالْفَضْلُ\nWA AN YURJAA MINKA ILLAL IHSAANU WAL FADL\nand to desire for anything from You save good turn and favoring.\nفَامْنُنْ عَلَيَّ بِمَاۤ اَوْجَبَهٗ فَضْلُكَ،\nFAMNUN A'LAYYA BIMAA AWJABAHOO FADLUK\nSo, (please) endue me with the favors that are incumbent upon You on the basis of Your graciousness\nوَلَا تَخْذُلْنِيْ بِمَا يَحْكُمُ بِهٖ عَدْلُكَ\nWA LAA TAKHDHULNEE BIMAA YAHKUMU BIHEE A'DLUK\nand do not disappoint me of that which is required by Your justice.\nسَيِّدِيْ لَوْ عَلِمَتِ الْاَرْضُ بِذُنُوْبِيْ لَسَاخَتْ بِيْ\nSAYYIDEE LAW A'LIMATIL ARDU BIDHUNOOBEE LASAAKHAT BEE\nMy Master, if the earth knew about my sins, it would swallow me;\nاَوِ الْجِبَالُ لَهَدَّتْنِيْ\nAWIL JIBAALU LAHADDATNEE\nif mountains knew about them, they would collapse on me;\nاَوِ السَّمَاوَاتُ لَاخْتَطَفَتْنِيْ\nAWIS SAMAAWAATU LAAKHTATAFATNEE\nif heavens knew about them, they would snatch me;\nاَوِ الْبِحَارُ لَاَغْرَقَتْنِيْ\nAWIL BIHAARU LA-AGHRAQATNEE\nand if oceans knew about them, they would down me!\nسَيِّدِيْ سَيِّدِيْ سَيِّدِيْ\nSAYYIDEE SAYYIDEE SAYYIDEE\nMy Master! My Master! My Master!\nمَوْلَايَ مَوْلَايَ مَوْلَايَ\nMAWLAAYA MAWLAAYA MAWLAAY\nMy Lord! My Lord! My Lord!\nقَدْ تَكَرَّرَ وُقُوْفِيْ لِضِيَافَتِكَ\nQAD TAKARRARA WUQOOFEE LIDIYAAFATIK\nFrequent has been my standing up in Your hospitability;\nفَلَا تَحْرِمْنِيْ مَا وَعَدْتَ الْمُتَعَرِّضِيْنَ لِمَسْاَلَتِكَ\nFALAA TAHRIMNEE MAA WA'ADTAL MUTA'ARRIDEENA LIMAS'ALATIK\nso, (please) do not deprive me of that which You have promised those who present themselves for praying You.\nيَا مَعْرُوْفَ الْعَارِفِيْنَ\nYAA MA'ROOFAL A'ARIFEEN\nO Well-known by the cognitive ones!\nيَا مَعْبُوْدَ الْعَابِدِيْنَ\nYAA MA'BOODAL A'ABIDEEN\nO Served by the worshippers!\nيَا مَشْكُوْرَ الشَّاكِرِيْنَ\nYAA MASHKOORASH SHAAKIREEN\nO Thanked by the thanksgivers!\nيَا جَلِيْسَ الذَّاكِرِيْنَ\nYAA JALEESADH DHAAKIREEN\nO Present in the sessions of the mindful ones!\nيَا مَحْمُوْدَ مَنْ حَمِدَهٗ\nYAA MAHMOODA MAN HAMIDAH\nO Praised by the praisers of Him!\nيَا مَوْجُوْدَ مَنْ طَلَبَهٗ\nYAA MAWJOODA MAN TALABAH\nO Nearby to those who seek for Him!\nيَا مَوْصُوْفَ مَنْ وَحَّدَهٗ\nYAA MAWSOOFA MAN WAHHADAH\nO Described by those who profess His Oneness!\nيَا مَحْبُوْبَ مَنْ اَحَبَّهٗ\nYAA MAHBOOBA MAN AHABBAH\nO Dearest of those who love Him!\nيَا غَوْثَ مَنْ اَرَادَهٗ\nYAA GHAWTHA MAN ARAADAH\nO Aide of those who require Him!\nيَا مَقْصُوْدَ مَنْ اَنَابَ اِلَيْهِ\nYAA MAQSOODA MAN ANAABA ILAYH\nO Purpose of those who turn to Him frequently!\nيَا مَنْ لَا يَعْلَمُ الْغَيْبَ اِلَّا هُوَ\nYAA MAN LAA YA'LAMUL GHAYBA ILLAA HUWA\nO He save Whom none knows the hidden!\nيَا مَنْ لَا يَصْرِفُ السُّوْۤءَ اِلَّا هُوَ\nYAA MAN LAA YASRIFUS SOO'A ILLAA HUWA\nO He save Whom none fends off evil!\nيَا مَنْ لَا يُدَبِّرُ الْاَمْرَ اِلَّا هُوَ\nYAA MAN LAA YUDABBIRUL AMRA ILLAA HUWA\nO He save Whom none manages the affairs!\nيَا مَنْ لَا يَغْفِرُ الذَّنْبَ اِلَّا هُوَ\nYAA MAN LAA YAGHFIRUDH DHANBA ILLAA HUWA\nO He save Whom none forgives sins!\nيَا مَنْ لَا يَخْلُقُ الْخَلْقَ اِلَّا هُوَ\nYAA MAN LAA YAKHLUQUL KHALQA ILLAA HUWA\nO He save Whom none creates the created beings!\nيَا مَنْ لَا يُنَزِّلُ الْغَيْثَ اِلَّا هُوَ\nYAA MAN LAA YUNAZZILUL GHAYTHA ILLAA HUWA\nO He save Whom none brings down rain!\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nPour down blessings upon Muhammad and Muhammad’s Household\nوَاغْفِرْ لِيْ يَا خَيْرَ الْغَافِرِيْنَ،\nWAGHFIR LEE YAA KHAYRAL GHAAFIREEN\nand forgive me, O best of all forgivers.\nرَبِّ اِنِّيْۤ اَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ حَيَاۤءٍ\nRABBI INNEE ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA HAYAA'\nO my Lord, I do implore for Your forgiveness timidly.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ رَجَاۤءٍ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA RAJAA'\nI implore for Your forgiveness hopefully.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ اِنَابَةٍ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA INAABAH\nI implore for Your forgiveness turning to You frequently.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ رَغْبَةٍ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA RAGHBAH\nI implore for Your forgiveness desiring for You.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ رَهْبَةٍ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA RAHBAH\nI implore for Your forgiveness, fearing You.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ طَاعَةٍ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA TAA'AH\nI implore for Your forgiveness obediently.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ اِيْمَانٍ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA EEMAAN\nI implore for Your forgiveness having faith in You.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ اِقْرَارٍ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA IQRAAR\nI implore for Your forgiveness professing of You.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ اِخْلَاصٍ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA IKHLAAS\nI implore for Your forgiveness sincerely.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ تَقْوٰى\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA TAQWAA\nI implore for Your forgiveness piously.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ تَوَكُّلٍ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA TAWAKKUL\nI implore for Your forgiveness, having full trust in You.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ ذِلَّةٍ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA DHILLAH\nI implore for Your forgiveness, showing submission to You.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ اسْتِغْفَارَ عَامِلٍ لَكَ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKAS TIGHFAARA A'AMILIN LAK\nI implore for Your forgiveness, dedicating all my acts to You\nهَارِبٍ مِنْكَ اِلَيْكَ\nHAARIBIN MINKA ILAYK\nand fleeing from You towards You.\nفَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ،\nFASALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nSo, (please) pour down blessings upon Muhammad and Muhammad’s Household\nوَتُبْ عَلَيَّ وَعَلٰى وَالِدَيَّ\nWA TUB A'LAYYA WA A'LAA WAALIDAYY\nand accept my and my parents’ repentance\nبِمَا تُبْتَ وَتَتُوْبُ عَلٰى جَمِيْعِ خَلْقِكَ\nBIMAA TUBTA WA TATOOBU A'LAA JAMEE'I KHALQIK\nthrough the means by which You did and will accept the repentance of all Your creatures.\nيَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nO most merciful of all those who show mercy!\nيَا مَنْ يُسَمّٰى بِالْغَفُوْرِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nYAA MAN YUSAMMAA BIL GHAFOORIR RAHEEM\nO He Who is called the All-forgiving, the All-merciful.\nيَا مَنْ يُسَمّٰى بِالْغَفُوْرِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nYAA MAN YUSAMMAA BIL GHAFOORIR RAHEEM\nO He Who is called the All-forgiving, the All-merciful.\nيَا مَنْ يُسَمّٰى بِالْغَفُوْرِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nYAA MAN YUSAMMAA BIL GHAFOORIR RAHEEM\nO He Who is called the All-forgiving, the All-merciful.\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nPour down blessings upon Muhammad and Muhammad’s Household,\nوَاقْبَلْ تَوْبَتِيْ\nWAQBAL TAWBATEE\naccept my repentance,\nوَزَكِّ عَمَلِيْ\nWA ZAKKI A'MALEE\npurify my deed,\nوَاشْكُرْ سَعْيِيْ\nWASHKUR SA'YEE\nappreciate my efforts,\nوَارْحَمْ ضَرَاعَتِيْ\nWARHAM DARAA'ATEE\nhave mercy upon my imploration,\nوَلَا تَحْجُبْ صَوْتِيْ\nWA LAA TAHJUB SAWTEE\ndo not interdict my voice,\nوَلَا تُخَيِّبْ مَسْاَلَتِيْ\nWA LAA TUKHAYYIB MAS'ALATEE\nand do not frustrate my prayers.\nيَا غَوْثَ الْمُسْتَغِيْثِيْنَ\nYAA GHAWTHAL MUSTAGHEETHEEN\nO Aide of those who seek aid!\nوَاَبْلِغْ اَئِمَّتِيْ سَلَامِيْ وَدُعَاۤئِيْ\nWA ABLIGH A'IMMATEE SALAAMEE WA DU'AA'EE\nAnd (please) convey my salutations and my prayers to my Leaders,\nوَشَفِّعْهُمْ فِيْ جَمِيْعِ مَا سَاَلْتُكَ\nWA SHAFFI'HUM FEE JAMEE'I MAA SA'ALTUK\naccept their intercession for me with You in all of that which I have asked You for,\nوَاَوْصِلْ هَدِيَّتِيْۤ اِلَيْهِمْ كَمَا يَنْبَغِيْ لَهُمْ\nWA AWSIL HADIYYATEE ILAYHIM KAMAA YANBAGHEE LAHUM\ndeliver my present to them in a way befitting their status,\nوَزِدْهُمْ مِنْ ذٰلِكَ مَا يَنْبَغِيْ لَكَ\nWA ZID-HUM MIN DHAALIKA MAA YANBAGHEE LAK\nand multiply that for them in a way befitting You\nبِاَضْعَافٍ لَا يُحْصِيْهَا غَيْرُكَ\nBI-AD'AAFIN LAA YUHSEEHAA GHAYRUK\nwith such folds that cannot be counted by anyone other than You.\nوَلَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِاللّٰهِ الْعَلِيِّ الْعَظِيْمِ\nWA LAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHIL A'LIYYIL A'ZEEM\nThere is neither might nor power except with Allah the All-High and All-great.\nوَصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلٰۤى اَطْيَبِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA SALLALLAAHU A'LAA ATYABIL MURSALEEN\nMay Allah bless the purest of the Messengers\nمُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ.\nMUHAMMADIN WA AALIHIT TAAHIREEN\nMuhammad and his Immaculate Household.",
    "Ziyarat al-Jawadiyya\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ اللهِ وَابْنَ اَوْلِيَآئِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WALIYYALLAAHI WABNA AWLIYAA'IH\nPeace be on you, O friend of Allah and the son of His friends.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَفِيْرَ اللهِ وَابْنَ سُفَرَآئِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAFEERALLAAHI WABNA SUFARAA'IH\nPeace be on you, O ambassador of Allah and the son of His ambassadors.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللهِ وَابْنَ حُجَجِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA HUJJATALLAAHI WABNA HUJAJIH\nPeace be on you, O proof of Allah and son of His proofs.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُوْرَ اللهِ فِيْ ظُلُمَاتِ الْاَرْضِ وَابْنَ اَنْوَارِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA NOORALLAAHI FEE ZULUMAATIL ARDI WABNA ANWAARIH\nPeace be on you, O light of Allah in the dark earth and the son of His lights.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَمُوْدَ الدِّيْنِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA A'MOODAD DEEN\nPeace be on you, O pillar of religion.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ الْاَنْبِيَآءِ وَالْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHAL ANBIYAA'I WAL MURSALEEN\nPeace be on you, O heir of the Prophets and the Messengers.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ آدَمَ صَفْوَةِ اللهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA AADAMA SAFWATILLAAH\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Adam, the one chosen by Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ نُوحٍ نَجِيِّ اللهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA NOOHIN NAJIYYILLAAH\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Nuh, the confidant of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ اِبْرَاهِيْمَ خَلِيْلِ اللهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA IBRAAHEEMA KHALEELILLAAH\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Ibrahim, the friend of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ اِسْمَاعِيْلَ ذَبِيْحِ اللهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA ISMAA'EELA DHABEEHILLAAH\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Isma'il, the one to be sacrificed for Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُوْسٰى كَلِيْمِ اللهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA MOOSAA KALEEMILLAAH\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Musa, the one who conversed with Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ عِيْسٰى رُوْحِ اللهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA I'EESAA ROOHILLAAH\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Isa, the spirit of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُحَمَّدٍ رَسُوْلِ اللهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA MUHAMMADIN RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Muhammad, the Prophet of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ عَلِيِّ بْنِ اَبِيْ طَالِبٍ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ وَلِيِّ اللهِ وَوَصِيِّ رَسُوْلِ اللهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA AMEERIL MU'MINEENA A'LIYYIBNI ABEE TAALIBIN A'LAYHIS SALAAMU WALIYYILLAAHI WA WASIYYI RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of the Commander of the Faithful, Ali Ibn Abi Talib, peace of Allah be on him, the friend of Allah, and the successor to the Prophet of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ فَاطِمَةَ الزَّهْرَآءِ سَيِّدَةِ نِسَآءِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ بِنْتِ رَسُوْلِ اللهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA FAATIMATAZ ZAHRAA'I SAYYIDATI NISAA'IL A'ALAMEENA BINTI RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Fatimah al-Zahra, leader of the women of the Universe, daughter of the Prophet of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ الْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَيْنِ سَيِّدَيْ شَبَابِ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHAL HASANI WAL HUSAYNI SAYYIDAY SHABAABI AHLIL JANNAH\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of al-Hasan and al-Husayn, the two leaders of all the youths in Paradise.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ عَلِيِّ بْنِ الْحُسَيْنِ سَيِّدِ السَّاجِدِيْنَ وَزَيْنِ الْعَابِدِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA A'LIYYIBNIL HUSAYNI SAYYIDIS SAAJIDEENA WA ZAYNIL A'ABIDEEN\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Ali ibn al-Husayn, the leader of the prostrating ones and the adornment of the worshippers.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ بَاقِرِ عِلْمِ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَالْآخِرِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA MUHAMMADIBNI A'LIYYIN BAAQIRI I'LMIL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHIREEN\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Muhammad ibn Ali, the one who splits knowledge of the first and last ones.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ جَعْفَرِ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ الصَّادِقِ الْبَارِّ التَّقِيِّ الْاَمِيْنِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA JA'FARIBNI MUHAMMADINIS SAADIQIL BAARRIT TAQIYYIL AMEEN\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Ja’far ibn Muhammad, the truthful, the virtuous one and trustworthy one.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُوْسَى بْنِ جَعْفَرٍ الْعَالِمِ الْكَاظِمِ الْحَفِيِّ الْحَلِيْمِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WAARITHA MOOSABNI JA'FARINIL A'ALIMIL KAAZIMIL HAFIYYIL HALEEM\nPeace be on you, O inheritor of Musa ibn Ja’far the knowledgeable, the suppressor of rage, the kind, the one of forbearance.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الصِّدِّيْقُ الشَّهِيْدُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAS SIDDEEQUSH SHAHEED\nPeace be on you, O truthful martyr.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْوَصِيُّ الرَّضِيُّ الْبَرُّ التَّقِيُّ الْوَفِيُّ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAL WASIYYUR RADIYYUL BARRUT TAQIYYUL WAFIYY\nPeace be on you, O successor who Allah is pleased with, pious, virtuous one.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْ اَقَمْتَ الصَّلَاةَ وَآتَيْتَ الزَّكَاةَ وَاَمَرْتَ بِالْمَعْرُوْفِ وَنَهَيْتَ عَنِ الْمُنْكَرِ وَعَبَدْتَ اللهَ مُخْلِصًا حَتّٰى اَتَاكَ الْيَقِيْنُ\nASH-HADU ANNAKA QAD AQAMTAS SALAATA WA AATAYTAZ ZAKAATA WA AMARTA BIL MA'ROOFI WA NAHAYTA A'NIL MUNKARI WA A'BADTALLAAHA MUKHLISAN HATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEEN\nI bear witness that you undertook the prayer and gave the zakat, enjoined the good and prohibited evil and worshipped Allah in all sincerity until death came to you.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اِمَامَ قَصِيْبٍ وَاِمَامَ نَجِيْبٍ وَاِمَامَ بَعِيْدٍ قَرِيْبٍ وَاِمَامَ مَسْمُوْمٍ غَرِيْبٍ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA IMAAMA QASEEBIN WA IMAAMA NAJEEBIN WA IMAAMA BA'EEDIN QAREEBIN WA IMAAMA MASMOOMIN GHAREEB\nPeace be on you, O the great Imam, and the eminent Imam, one who is near, distant, one who was poisoned and stranger.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْعَالِمُ النَّبِيْهُ وَالْقَدْرُ الْوَجِيْهُ النَّازِحُ عَنْ تُرْبَةِ جَدِّهٖ وَاَبِيْهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA AYYUHAL A'ALIMUN NABEEHU WAL QADRUL WAJEEHUN NAAZIHU A'N TURBATI JADDIHEE WA ABEEH\nPeace be on you, O the exalted scholar having notable powers, one who is distant from the land of his grandfather and father.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنْ اَمَرَ اَوْلَادَهٗ وَعِيَالَهٗ بِالنِّيَاحَةِ عَلَيْهِ قَبْلَ وُصُوْلِ الْقَتْلِ اِلَيْهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MAN AMARA AWLAADAHOO WA I'YAALAHOO BIN NIYAAHATI A'LAYHI QABLA WUSOOLIL QATLI ILAYH\nPeace be on the one who commanded his children and family to cry for him before he was killed.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى دِيَارِكُمُ الْمُوْحِشَاتِ كَمَا اسْتَوْحَشَتْ مِنْكُمْ مِنٰى وَعَرَفَاتٌ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA DIYAARIKUMUL MOOHISHAATI KAMAS TAWHASHAT MINKUM MINAA WA A'RAFAAT\nPeace be on your lonely homes, just as Mina and ‘Arafat have been separated from you.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى سَادَاتِ الْعَبِيْدِ وَعُدَّةِ الْوَعِيْدِ وَالْبِئْرِ الْمُعَطَّلَةِ وَالْقَصْرِ الْمَشِيْدِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA SAADAATIL A'BEEDI WA U'DDATIL WA'EEDI WAL BI'RIL MU'ATTALATI WAL QASRIL MASHEED\nPeace be upon the masters of the servants, the provision against the threatened punishment, the abandoned well and the lofty palace.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى غَوْثِ اللَّهْفَانِ وَمَنْ صَارَتْ بِهٖ اَرْضُ خُرَاسَانَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA GHAWTHIL LAHFAANI WA MAN SAARAT BIHEE ARDU KHURAASAAN\nPeace be upon the rescuer of the distressed, through whom the land of Khurasan became what it is.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى قَلِيْلِ الزَّآئِرِيْنَ وَقُرَّةِ عَيْنِ فَاطِمَةَ سَيِّدَةِ نِسَآءِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA QALEELIZ ZAA'IREENA WA QURRATI A'YNI FAATIMATA SAYYIDATI NISAA'IL A'ALAMEEN\nPeace be upon him whose visitors are few, the delight of the eye of Fatimah, the leader of the women of the worlds.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى الْبَهْجَةِ الرَّضَوِيَّةِ وَالْاَخْلَاقِ الرَّضِيَّةِ وَالْغُصُوْنِ الْمُتَفَرِّعَةِ مِنَ الشَّجَرَةِ الْاَحْمَدِيَّةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAL BAHJATIR RADAWIYYATI WAL AKHLAAQIR RADIYYATI WAL GHUSOONIL MUTAFARRI'ATI MINASH SHAJARATIL AHMADIYYAH\nPeace be upon the splendour of al-Reza, the pleasing character, and the branches spreading from the tree of Ahmad.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنِ انْتَهٰى اِلَيْهِ رِئَاسَةُ الْمُلْكِ الْاَعْظَمِ وَعِلْمُ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ لِتَمَامِ الْاَمْرِ الْمُحْكَمِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MANIN TAHAA ILAYHI RI'AASATUL MULKIL A'ZAMI WA I'LMU KULLI SHAY'IN LITAMAAMIL AMRIL MUHKAM\nPeace be on the one to whom the leadership of the mighty kingdom reached, with the knowledge of everything to its ultimate, predestined end.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنْ اَسْمَآؤُهُمْ وَسِيْلَةُ السَّائِلِيْنَ وَهَيَاكِلُهُمْ اَمَانُ الْمَخْلُوْقِيْنَ وَحُجَجُهُمْ اِبْطَالُ شُبَهِ الْمُلْحِدِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MAN ASMAA'UHUM WASEELATUS SAA'ILEENA WA HAYAAKILUHUM AMAANUL MAKHLOOQEENA WA HUJAJUHUM IBTAALU SHUBAHIL MULHIDEEN\nPeace be on those whose names are a medium for those who seek, their houses are a security for the creatures, their proofs nullify the uncertainty of those who deviate.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنْ كُسِرَتْ لَهٗ وِسَادَةُ وَالِدِهٖ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ حَتّٰى خَصَمَ اَهْلَ الْكُتُبِ وَثَبَّتَ قَوَاعِدَ الدِّيْنِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MAN KUSIRAT LAHOO WISAADATU WAALIDIHEE AMEERIL MU'MINEENA HATTAA KHASAMA AHLAL KUTUBI WA THABBATA QAWAA'IDAD DEEN\nPeace be on the one for whom the cushion of his father, the Commander of the Faithful, was laid out so that he could dispute with the people of the book and strengthen the pillars of religion.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى عَلَمِ الْاَعْلَامِ وَمَنْ كُسِرَتْ قُلُوْبُ شِيْعَتِهٖ بِغُرْبَتِهٖ اِلٰى يَوْمِ الْقِيَامَةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA A'LAMIL A'LAAMI WA MAN KUSIRAT QULOOBU SHEE'ATIHEE BIGHURBATIHEE ILAA YAWMIL QIYAAMAH\nPeace be on the distinguished one amongst the eminent ones, for whom the hearts of his Shi’ah are broken due to his loneliness until the day of Judgment.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى السِّرَاجِ الْوَهَّاجِ وَالْبَحْرِ الْعَجَّاجِ الَّذِيْ صَارَتْ تُرْبَتُهٗ مَهْبَطَ الْاَمْلَاكِ وَالْمِعْرَاجِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAS SIRAAJIL WAHHAAJI WAL BAHRIL A'JJAAJIL LADHEE SAARAT TURBATUHOO MAHBATAL AMLAAKI WAL MI'RAAJ\nPeace be upon the blazing lamp and the surging sea, whose soil has become the place where the angels descend and ascend.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى اُمَرَآءِ الْاِسْلَامِ وَمُلُوْكِ الْاِيْمَانِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA UMARAA'IL ISLAAMI WA MULOOKIL EEMAAN\nPeace be on the leaders of Islam and the rulers of faith.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى بَاهِرِيْ النُّوْرِ وَطَاهِرِي الْوِلَادَةِ وَمَنْ اَطْلَعَهُمُ اللهُ عَلٰى عُلُوْمِ الْغَيْبِ وَالشَّهَادَةِ وَجَعَلَهُمْ بِاِفْضَالِهِ مَنْبَعَ الْهُدٰى وَمَعْدِنَ السَّعَادَةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA BAAHIRIN NOORI WA TAAHIRIL WILAADATI WA MAN ATLA'AHUMULLAAHU A'LAA U'LOOMIL GHAYBI WASH SHAHAADATI WA JA'ALAHUM BI-IFDAALIHEE MANBA'AL HUDAA WA MA'DINAS SA'AADAH\nPeace be on brilliant light, and the ones born in purity, and for whom Allah has made knowledge of the unseen available, and made them source of guidance and treasure of prosperity by His bestowal.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنِ ابْتَهَجَتْ بِهٖ مَعَالِمُ طُوْسٍ حَيْثُ حَلَّ بِرَبْعِهَا\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MANIB TAHAJAT BIHEE MA'AALIMU TOOSIN HAYTHU HALLA BIRAB'IHAA\nPeace be upon him through whom the landmarks of Tus rejoiced when he settled in its land.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مُفْتَخَرِ الْاَبْرَارِ وَنَائِيْ الْمَزَارِ وَشَرْطِ دُخُوْلِ الْجَنَّةِ وَالنَّارِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MUFTAKHARIL ABRAARI WA NAA'IL MAZAARI WA SHARTI DUKHOOLIL JANNATI WAN NAAR\nPeace be upon the pride of the righteous, whose shrine is far away, and who is the condition for entering Paradise and Hell.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنْ لَمْ يَقْطَعِ اللهُ عَنْهُمْ صَلٰواتِهٖ فِيْ آنَاءِ السَّاعَاتِ وَبِهِمْ سَكَنَتِ السَّوَاكِنُ وَتَحَرَّكَتِ الْمُتَحَرِّكَاتُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MAN LAM YAQTA'ILLAAHU A'NHUM SALAWAATIHEE FEE AANAA'IS SAA'AATI WA BIHIM SAKANATIS SAWAAKINU WA TAHARRAKATIL MUTAHARRIKAAT\nPeace be on the one for whom Allah has not cut off His blessings day and night, and through whom the people live and move.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنْ جَعَلَ اِمَامَتَهُمْ مُمَيِّزَةً بَيْنَ الْفَرِيْقَيْنِ كَمَا تَعَبَّدَ بِوَلَايَتِهِمْ اَهْلُ الْخَافِقَيْنِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MAN JA'ALA IMAAMATAHUM MUMAYYIZATAN BAYNAL FAREEQAYNI KAMAA TA'ABBADA BIWALAAYATIHIM AHLUL KHAAFIQAYN\nPeace be on those whose Imamate Allah has made a distinguishing mark between two groups, the people of the east and the west become more devout by following them.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنْ اَحْيَا اللهُ بِهِمْ دَارِسَ حِكَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ وَابْتَعَثَهُمْ بِوَلَايَتِهِمْ لِتَمَامِ كَلِمَةِ اللهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MAN AHYALLAAHU BIHIM DAARISA HIKAMIN NABIYYEENA WABTA'ATHAHUM BIWALAAYATIHIM LITAMAAMI KALIMATILLAAHI RABBIL A'ALAMEEN\nPeace be on the one through whom Allah has enlivened the wisdom of the Prophets and, by sending him, people become more devout so as to perfect the word of Allah, Lord of the Worlds.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى شُهُوْرِ الْحَوْلِ وَعَدَدِ السَّاعَاتِ وَعَدَدِ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ فِيْ رُقُوْمِ الْمُسَطَّرَاتِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA SHUHOORIL HAWLI WA A'DADIS SAA'AATI WA A'DADI LAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU FEE RUQOOMIL MUSATTARAAT\nPeace be on the months of the year and number of hours and the number of Laa elaaha illal laah in the written document.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى اِقْبَالِ الدُّنْيَا وَسُعُوْدِهَا وَمَنْ سُئِلُوْا عَنْ كَلِمَةِ التَّوْحِيْدِ فَقَالُوْا نَحْنُ وَاللهِ مِنْ شُرُوْطِهَا\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA IQBAALID DUNYAA WA SU'OODIHAA WA MAN SU'ILOO A'N KALIMATIT TAWHEEDI FAQAALOO NAHNU WALLAAHI MIN SHUROOTIHAA\nPeace be on the one [through whom] the world and its prosperity are to be approached and the one who, when asked about the words of unity, said: “By Allah, we are its conditions”\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنْ يُعَلَّلُ وُجُوْدُ كُلِّ مَخْلُوْقٍ بِوِلَائِهِمْ وَمَنْ خَطَبَتْ لَهُمُ الْخُطَبَآءُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MAN YU'ALLALU WUJOODU KULLI MAKHLOOQIN BIWILAA'IHIM WA MAN KHATABAT LAHUMUL KHUTABAA'\nPeace be on the one whose friendship is the reason for the existence of every creature, the preachers address.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنْ عَلَا مَجْدُهُمْ وَثَنَآؤُهُمْ وَفَاقَ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَالْآخِرِيْنَ اٰبَآؤُهُمْ وَاَبْنَآؤُهُمْ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MAN A'LAA MAJDUHUM WA THANAA'UHUM WA FAAQAL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHIREENA AABAA'UHUM WA ABNAA'UHUM\nPeace be upon those whose glory and praise are exalted, and whose fathers and sons surpass the first and the last.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَنِ افْتَخَرَ الْفَخْرُ بِفَخْرِهِمْ وَعَلَا بِهِمْ بِوُجُوْبِ الصَّلَاةِ عَلَيْهِمْ وَطَهَارَةِ ثِيَابِهِمْ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MANIF TAKHARAL FAKHRU BIFAKHRIHIM WA A'LAA BIHIM BIWUJOOBIS SALAATI A'LAYHIM WA TAHAARATI THIYAABIHIM\nPeace be upon those by whose pride pride itself takes pride, who are exalted by the duty of sending blessings upon them and by the purity of their garments.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى قَمَرِ الْاَقْمَارِ وَفَخْرِ الْاَبْرَارِ الْمُتَكَلِّمِ مَعَ كُلِّ لُغَةٍ بِلِسَانِهِمُ الْقَائِلِ لِشِيْعَتِهٖ مَا كَانَ اللهُ لِيُوَلِّيَ اِمَامًا عَلٰى اُمَّةٍ حَتّٰى يُعَرِّفَهٗ بِلُغَاتِهِمْ وَاَدْيَانِهِمْ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA QAMARIL AQMAARI WA FAKHRIL ABRAARIL MUTAKALLIMI MA'A KULLI LUGHATIN BILISAANIHIMUL QAA'ILI LISHEE'ATIHEE MAA KAANALLAAHU LIYUWALLIYA IMAAMAN A'LAA UMMATIN HATTAA YU'ARRIFAHOO BILUGHAATIHIM WA ADYAANIHIM\nPeace be on the moon of all moons, the pride of the righteous, the one who speaks to different people in their own languages, the one who said to his followers: “Allah would not impose an Imam on a community until He teaches him their language and ways”\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى فُرْحَةِ الْقُلُوْبِ وَفَرَجِ الْمَكْرُوْبِ وَشَرِيْفِ الْاَشْرَافِ وَمَفْخَرِ عَبْدِ مَنَافٍ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA FURHATIL QULOOBI WA FARAJIL MAKROOBI WA SHAREEFIL ASHRAAFI WA MAFKHARI A'BDI MANAAF\nPeace be on the happiness of the heart, one who removes sorrow and the noble of all noble ones and the pride of ‘Abd al-Manaf.\nيَا لَيْتَنِيْ كُنْتُ مِنَ الطَّآئِفِيْنَ بِعَرْصَةِ حَضْرَتِهٖ مُسْتَشْهِدًا لِبَهْجَةِ مُؤَانَسَتِهٖ\nYAA LAYTANEE KUNTU MINAT TAA'IFEENA BI-A'RSATI HADRATIHEE MUSTASH-HIDAN LIBAHJATI MU'AANASATIH\nIf only I was around his court and in his presence, I would give my life due to the joy of his friendship.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى الْاِمَامِ الرَّؤُوْفِ الَّذِيْ هَيَّجَ اَحْزَانَ يَوْمِ الطُّفُوْفِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAL IMAAMIR RA'OOFIL LADHEE HAYYAJA AHZAANA YAWMIT TUFOOF\nPeace be on the kind Imam who inspires sadness on the day of Ashura.\nبِاللهِ اُقْسِمُ وَبِآبَائِكَ الْاَطْهَارِ وَبِاَبْنَآئِكَ الْمُنْتَجَبِيْنَ الْاَبْرَارِ لَوْ لَا بُعْدُ الشُّقَّةِ حَيْثُ شَطَّتْ بِكُمُ الدَّارُ لَقَضَيْتُ بَعْضَ وَاجِبِ حَقِّكُمْ بِتَكْرَارِ الْمَزَارِ\nBILLAAHI UQSIMU WA BI-AABAA'IKAL AT-HAARI WA BI-ABNAA'IKAL MUNTAJABEENAL ABRAARI LAW LAA BU'DUSH SHUQQATI HAYTHU SHATTAT BIKUMUD DAARU LAQADAYTU BA'DA WAAJIBI HAQQIKUM BITAKRAARIL MAZAAR\nI swear by Allah and by your pure fathers and the chosen ones amongst your pious children, had it not been for the excessive distance from home, I would have fulfilled some obligations by continuously visiting you.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا حُمَاةَ الدِّيْنِ وَاَوْلَادَ النَّبِيِّيْنَ وَسَادَةَ الْمَخْلُوْقِيْنَ وَرَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM YAA HUMAATAD DEENI WA AWLAADAN NABIYYEENA WA SAADATAL MAKHLOOQEENA WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace be on you, O the protectors of religion, the children of the Prophets and the leaders of creation, may the mercy and blessings of Allah be on you.\nThen pray the two-unit prayer of the ziyarat, glorify Allah, and offer them as a gift to Imam al-Reza (a.s.). Then recite the dua in the tab \"Dua after the Ziyarat Prayer\"; do not leave it out after this ziyarat.",
    "Other Forms (Ibn Qulawayh, al-Mufid)\nIbn Qulawayh’s form: when you reach the tomb, recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى عَلِيِّ بْنِ مُوْسَى\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA A'LIYYIBNI MOOSAA\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon `Ali the son of Musa,\nالرِّضَا الْمُرْتَضٰى\nAR-RIDAL MURTADAA\nthe cordial, the well-pleased,\nاَلْاِمَامِ التَّقِيِّ النَّقِيِّ\nAL-IMAAMIT TAQIYYIN NAQIYY\nthe Imam, the pious, the bright,\nوَحُجَّتِكَ عَلٰى مَنْ فَوْقَ الْاَرْضِ وَمَنْ تَحْتَ الثَّرٰى\nWA HUJJATIKA A'LAA MAN FAWQAL ARDI WA MAN TAHTATH THARAA\nYour argument against whoever is above the earth and whoever is beneath the dust,\nاَلصِّدِّيْقِ الشَّهِيْدِ\nAS-SIDDEEQISH SHAHEED\nand the ever-truthful and martyr\nصَلٰوةً كَثِيْرَةً تَآمَّةً زَاكِيَةً\nSALAATAN KATHEERATAN TAAMMATAN ZAAKIYAH\nwith such blessings that are very much, perfect, purified,\nمُتَوَاصِلَةً مُتَوَاتِرَةً مُتَرَادِفَةً\nMUTAWAASILATAN MUTAWAATIRATAN MUTARAADIFAH\ncontinuous, uninterrupted, and consecutive,\nكَاَفْضَلِ مَا صَلَّيْتَ عَلٰۤى اَحَدٍ مِنْ اَوْلِيَاۤئِكَ.\nKA-AFDALI MAA SALLAYTA A'LAA AHADIN MIN AWLIYAA'IK\nand with the best form of blessings that You have ever bestowed upon any of Your intimate servants.\nAl-Mufid’s form: after the ghusl of ziyarat, in your purest clothes, stand at the tomb and recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ اللّٰهِ وَابْنَ وَلِيِّهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WALIYYALLAAHI WABNA WALIYYIH\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s authority and son of His authority.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللّٰهِ وَابْنَ حُجَّتِهٖ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA HUJJATALLAAHI WABNA HUJJATIH\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s argument and son of His argument.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اِمَامَ الْهُدٰى وَالْعُرْوَةَ الْوُثْقٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA IMAAMAL HUDAA WAL U'RWATAL WUTHQAA\nPeace be upon you, O leader to true guidance and firmest handle (of Islam).\nوَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nAllah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ مَضَيْتَ عَلٰى مَا مَضٰى عَلَيْهِ اٰبَاۤؤُكَ الطَّاهِرُوْنَ\nASH-HADU ANNAKA MADAYTA A'LAA MAA MADAA A'LAYHI AABAA'UKAT TAAHIROON\nI bear witness that you passed away carrying the same principles on which your immaculate fathers had passed away.\nصَلَوَاتُ اللّٰهِ عَلَيْهِمْ\nSALAWAATULLAAHI A'LAYHIM\nAllah’s blessings be upon them.\nلَمْ تُؤْثِرْ عَمًى عَلٰى هُدًى\nLAM TU'THIR A'MAN A'LAA HUDAA\nYou never preferred blindness to true guidance\nوَلَمْ تَمِلْ مِنْ حَقٍّ اِلٰى بَاطِلٍ\nWA LAM TAMIL MIN HAQQIN ILAA BAATIL\nand never slanted from right to wrong.\nوَاَنَّكَ نَصَحْتَ لِلّٰهِ وَلِرَسُوْلِهٖ وَاَدَّيْتَ الْاَمَانَةَ\nWA ANNAKA NASAHTA LILLAAHI WA LIRASOOLIHEE WA ADDAYTAL AMAANAH\nAnd you acted for the sake of Allah and His Messenger sincerely and fulfilled the trust.\nفَجَزَاكَ اللّٰهُ عَنِ الْاِسْلَامِ وَاَهْلِهٖ خَيْرَ الْجَزَاۤءِ\nFAJAZAAKALLAAHU A'NIL ISLAAMI WA AHLIHEE KHAYRAL JAZAA'\nMay Allah reward you on behalf of Islam and its embracers with the most favorable reward.\nاَتَيْتُكَ بِاَبِيْ وَاُمِّيْ زَاۤئِرًا عَارِفًا بِحَقِّكَ\nATAYTUKA BI-ABEE WA UMMEE ZAA'IRAN A'ARIFAN BIHAQQIK\nI have come to you, may my father and mother be your ransom, visiting you, recognizing your right,\nمُوَالِيًا لِاَوْلِيَاۤئِكَ مُعَادِيًا لِاَعْدَاۤئِكَ\nMUWAALIYAN LI-AWLIYAA'IKA MU'AADIYAN LI-A'DAA'IK\ndeclaring loyalty to your loyalists, and showing enmity towards your enemies.\nفَاشْفَعْ لِيْ عِنْدَ رَبِّكَ.\nFASHFA' LEE I'NDA RABBIK\nSo, intercede for me with your Lord.\nThen lay yourself on the tomb, kiss it, and place both cheeks on it. Then turn to the side of the Imam’s head and recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَوْلَايَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA MAWLAAY\nPeace be upon you, O my master,\nيَا ابْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nYABNA RASOOLILLAAHI WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nO son of Allah’s Messenger. Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ الْاِمَامُ الْهَادِيْ وَالْوَلِيُّ الْمُرْشِدُ\nASH-HADU ANNAKAL IMAAMUL HAADEE WAL WALIYYUL MURSHID\nI bear witness that you are verily the guiding leader and the directing saint.\nاَبْرَاُ اِلَى اللّٰهِ مِنْ اَعْدَاۤئِكَ\nABRA'U ILALLAAHI MIN A'DAA'IK\nI repudiate your enemies in the presence of Allah\nوَاَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَى اللّٰهِ بِوِلَايَتِكَ\nWA ATAQARRABU ILALLAAHI BIWILAAYATIK\nand seek nearness to Allah through declaring loyalty to you.\nصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْكَ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ.\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAYKA WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nMay Allah bless you. Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nThen pray the two-unit prayer of the ziyarat, and any other prayers you wish. Then turn to the side of the Imam’s feet and ask Allah for whatever you want.",
    "Farewell\nWhen you are leaving, bid him farewell with the farewell of the Prophet (s.a.w.a.), which opens:\nلَا جَعَلَهُ اللهُ اٰخِرَ تَسْلِيْمِيْ عَلَيْكَ\nLAA JA'ALAHULLAAHU AAKHIRA TASLEEMEE A'LAYK\nMay Allah not make this my last greeting to you.\nYou may also recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ اللّٰهِ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WALIYYALLAAHI WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace and Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you, O Allah’s authority.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَا تَجْعَلْهُ اٰخِرَ الْعَهْدِ\nALLAAHUMMA LAA TAJ'ALHU AAKHIRAL A'HD\nO Allah, (please) do not decide this visit\nمِنْ زِيَارَتِيْ اِبْنَ نَبِيِّكَ وَحُجَّتَكَ عَلٰى خَلْقِكَ\nMIN ZIYAARATIBNA NABIYYIKA WA HUJJATAKA A'LAA KHALQIK\nto be the last of my visit to the son of Your Prophet and Your argument against Your creatures.\nوَاجْمَعْنِيْ وَاِيَّاهُ فِيْ جَنَّتِكَ\nWAJMA'NEE WA IYYAAHU FEE JANNATIK\nInclude me with him in Your Paradise\nوَاحْشُرْنِيْ مَعَهٗ وَفِيْ حِزْبِهٖ\nWAHSHURNEE MA'AHOO WA FEE HIZBIH\nand involve me with him and with his group\nمَعَ الشُّهَدَاۤءِ وَالصَّالِحِيْنَ\nMA'ASH SHUHADAA'I WAS SAALIHEEN\nwith the martyrs and the righteous ones;\nوَحَسُنَ اُوْلٰۤئِكَ رَفِيْقًا\nWA HASUNA OOLAA'IKA RAFEEQAA\nand excellent the companionship of these is.\nوَاَسْتَوْدِعُكَ اللّٰهَ وَاسْتَرْعِيْكَ\nWA ASTAWDI'UKALLAAHA WASTAR'EEK\nI entrust you with Allah, ask Him to keep you under His custody,\nوَاَقْرَاُ عَلَيْكَ السَّلَامَ\nWA AQRA'U A'LAYKAS SALAAM\nand invoke His blessings upon you.\nاٰمَنَّا بِاللّٰهِ وَبِالرَّسُوْلِ\nAAMANNAA BILLAAHI WA BIR RASOOL\nWe believe in Allah, in the Messenger,\nوَبِمَا جِئْتَ بِهٖ وَدَلَلْتَ عَلَيْهِ\nWA BIMAA JI'TA BIHEE WA DALALTA A'LAYH\nand in whatever you have come with and instructed.\nفَاكْتُبْنَا مَعَ الشَّاهِدِيْنَ.\nFAKTUBNAA MA'ASH SHAAHIDEEN\nSo, (please) write us down with those who bear witness."
  ],
  "merits": "First Ziyarat: several ziyarats of Imam al-Reza (a.s.) are reported. The best known is the one in the most reliable books, reported from Shaykh Muhammad ibn al-Hasan ibn al-Walid, one of the teachers of Shaykh al-Saduq; the Mazar of Ibn Qulawayh shows that it is also reported from the Imams (a.s.). This is its form as given in Shaykh al-Saduq’s Man La Yahduruhu al-Faqih, and it is the most excellent of them.\n\nOne phrase of it reads وَسَخِرُوْا بِاِمَامِكَ (\"and scoffed at Your Imam\") in Man La Yahduruhu al-Faqih, Uyun Akhbar al-Reza and the books of Allamah al-Majlisi: they mocked the Imam You appointed for them. Misbah al-Za’ir has وَسَخِرُوْا بِاَيَّامِكَ (\"and scoffed at Your Days\"), which is also sound and may be the better reading, since by the narration of Saqr ibn Abi Dulaf the Days are the Imams (a.s.).\n\nPermission to Enter: the general form of asking permission at the shrines of the Imams (a.s.) (al-Kaf’ami’s al-Balad al-Amin; Misbah al-Za’ir). At another Imam’s shrine, his name is said in place of Imam al-Reza’s.\n\nDua after the Ziyarat Prayer: in Tuhfat al-Za’ir it is reported from Shaykh al-Mufid that this dua is recommended after the prayer of the ziyarat of Imam al-Reza (a.s.).\n\nZiyarat al-Jawadiyya: Allamah al-Majlisi quotes this ziyarat in Bihar al-Anwar from books of some of the early scholars; it is known as al-Jawadiyya, after Imam al-Jawad (a.s.). After it, he says, pray the two units of the ziyarat, glorify Allah and offer them to Imam al-Reza (a.s.), then recite the dua beginning اَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْۤ اَسْاَلُكَ يَاۤ اَللّٰهُ الدَّاۤئِمُ (the tab \"Dua after the Ziyarat Prayer\"). Whoever visits him with this ziyarat should not leave that dua out. Some copies add \"the beloved of Allah\" after \"Muhammad\", and \"and the two grandsons of the Messenger of Allah\" after \"the youth of Paradise\".\n\nOther Forms: Ibn Qulawayh reports the salawat from one of the Imams (a.s.). Shaykh al-Mufid reports the second form in al-Muqni’ah.\n\nVisiting Imam al-Reza (a.s.) at the times connected with him brings a great reward: especially in Rajab, on the 23rd and 25th of Dhul Qa’dah, and on the 6th of Ramazan, and on the other days connected with him.\n\nFarewell: the farewell to Imam al-Reza (a.s.) is the farewell recited to the Prophet (s.a.w.a.)."
}
